<BaseLayout title="About Buy Better Finds | Our Research & Editorial Approach" description="Meet Buy Better Finds, an independent product research and shopping recommendation site. Learn how we compare products, explain tradeoffs, and make recommendations.">
  <article class="article">
    <div class="eyebrow">About us</div>
    <h1>Independent Product Research for More Confident Shopping</h1>
    <p class="lead">Buy Better Finds is an independent product research and shopping recommendation website. We help shoppers evaluate products, compare meaningful differences, and understand the tradeoffs before making a purchase. Our goal is not to add to the noise—it is to make product research clearer and shopping decisions more confident.</p>
    <p>Our goal is to help shoppers understand what matters before spending their money. Instead of overwhelming you with endless choices, we focus on specific products and practical information that makes comparisons easier.</p>

    <h2>Our editorial approach</h2>
    <p>We research specific products, consider intended use and practical features, explain meaningful tradeoffs, and identify the type of shopper a product may suit best. We aim to add original commentary and analysis rather than simply reproducing retailer descriptions.</p>
    <p>Our editorial selections are made independently. A product is not recommended because it pays us more, and an affiliate relationship does not determine the Buy Better Score.</p>
    <p><a href="/why-we-recommend/">Read our full recommendation methodology →</a></p>

    <h2>How we use scores</h2>
    <p>The Buy Better Score is our editorial assessment on a 10-point scale. It considers practical use-case fit, useful features, value, limitations, and documented tradeoffs. It is not an Amazon customer rating, and it is not an Amazon designation.</p>

    <h2>Independence and affiliate relationships</h2>
    <p>Buy Better Finds may participate in affiliate programs. If you purchase through a qualifying affiliate link, we may earn a commission at no additional cost to you. Affiliate compensation does not guarantee a recommendation or positive coverage.</p>
    <p><strong>As an Amazon Associate I earn from qualifying purchases.</strong></p>

    <h2>Prices and product information</h2>
    <p>Prices, availability, specifications, promotions, shipping, and return policies can change. Always confirm current information with the retailer or manufacturer before purchasing.</p>

    <h2>Product imagery</h2>
    <p>Product imagery is sourced from manufacturer media resources, authorized press materials, original photography, or other sources where appropriate usage rights are established. We do not represent retailer or manufacturer imagery as original photography.</p>

    <h2>Review cadence</h2>
    <p>Product pages display a research-updated date. When meaningful product changes, availability issues, or new alternatives affect a recommendation, we can revisit the page and update the editorial assessment.</p>

    <h2>Our promise</h2>
    <p>Clearer information, useful recommendations, transparent affiliate relationships, and a better shopping experience.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
